    <p>3. Renewal and cancellation: the 7-Day Pass is a one-time payment and does not renew. Monthly and yearly plans renew automatically every month (or year) from the purchase date. You can cancel at any time through Link (link.com). If you cancel before the next renewal date, you will not be charged again. After you cancel, you can keep using the plan until the end of the period you have paid for.</p>
    <p>4. Refunds: because the Service is digital content, we do not accept returns, refunds or cancellations for reasons of personal convenience. In principle we also do not refund periods after a renewal or give pro-rated refunds. However, if you were charged twice, or you cannot use the Service because of a defect, please email us. We will review it and refund you if appropriate.</p>
